#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:9
msgid "Native Physics API Access"
msgstr "访问原生物理 API"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"Native physics APIs are backend-specific escape hatches. They can bypass "
"Isaac Lab's buffering, validation, ordering, and lifecycle management. Use "
"the unified asset and sensor APIs unless an engine-native capability or a "
"lower-overhead data path is required."
msgstr ""
"原生物理 API 提供特定后端的底层访问方式，可能绕过 Isaac Lab "
"的缓冲、验证、顺序转换和生命周期管理。除非需要引擎原生功能或开销更低的数据路径，否则应使用统一的资源和传感器 API。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:19
msgid "Choose an access level"
msgstr "选择访问层级"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"Use native access only when the unified APIs do not provide a capability or "
"data path that the workload needs. Keep it close to the component that owns "
"the simulation state. For the portable API boundary and backend lifecycle, "
"see :ref:`backend-architecture`."
msgstr ""
"只有统一 API 无法提供工作负载所需功能或数据路径时，才使用原生访问，并将相关代码放在持有仿真状态的组件附近。可跨后端使用的 API "
"边界与后端生命周期见 :ref:`backend-architecture` 。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:26
msgid "Use the unified Isaac Lab data and write APIs for portable task code."
msgstr "为需要跨后端运行的任务代码使用 Isaac Lab 统一的数据与写入 API。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Reuse an Isaac Lab-owned native handle when its selection already matches."
msgstr "如果已有选择符合需要，复用 Isaac Lab 持有的原生句柄。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"Create raw engine access only for a selection or capability that the owning "
"Isaac Lab object does not expose."
msgstr "只有持有对象的 Isaac Lab 组件未提供所需选择或功能时，才自行创建底层引擎访问。"

